'''Swan's Room''' is a [[sub-location]].

==Appearance==
Swan's Room is a big area with many big windows around it, a pink octagon-shaped symbol in the middle of the ground, and a big white circle on the top of the room.

==Location==
===Entrance===
The entrance to Swan's Room can be found directly inside the [[Mansion (Second Sea)|Mansion]], at the end of the stairs.
===Swan's Room===
Swan's Room can be found inside one of the mountains near [[Jeremy]]'s spawn location.

==Accessing==
* The player has to be Lv. 1000 and give a [[Blox Fruit]] worth more than {{Money|1,000,000}} [[Money]] to [[Trevor]] in order to enter the room through the gate.
** Alternatively, the player can access Swan's Room by using [[Flash Step]] through one of the mountains near [[Jeremy]]'s spawn location, and then doing it again through one of the room's walls. (However, players cannot damage Swan if they are below Lv. 1000.)

==Inhabitants==
[[Don Swan]] is the only inhabitant of Swan's Room.

==Notes==
* The player does not necessarily need to be Lv. 1000 to enter Swan's Room, as doing the glitch mentioned above can allow lower-leveled players to enter, although they will not be able to damage [[Don Swan]].

==Trivia==
* Swan's Room shares the same soundtrack with the [[Battle of the Gods]] and [[Liberation of Tiki Outpost]].
* The walls in the inside of the room were red during [[Updates/29|Update 29]].

